# ML2PP-Textual-Zahra

This folder contains Zahra’s textual ML2++ tutorial and sources.

## Contents
- `tutorial/quickstart.md` – step-by-step guide
- `src/` – example ML2++ models / code
- `images/` – screenshots used in the tutorial

## Quick start
1) Open files under `tutorial/`.
2) Run the sample under `src/`.

